  <h1>Haskell vs Rust</h1>
  <div class="artmeta"><span>Par Coldwast</span><span>Mis a jour le 20 sept. 2026</span><span>9 min de lecture</span><span class="tag">#haskell</span><span class="tag">#rust</span></div>
